{"data":{"title":"Music for a black berret","slug":"music-for-a-black-berret","path":"/artists/chief/tracks/music-for-a-black-berret/","artwork":"images/artists/chief/tracks/music-for-a-black-berret.jpg","artist":{"id":"Q_JTQvi6Ybs","slug":"chief","links":null,"title":"Chief","artwork":null},"id":"6J6ZY03Rd0c"},"appearanceCount":4,"markers":[{"chapter":{"id":"UQKUtJsffKA","show":{"id":"cdnqQ9xehXc","slug":"195","title":"Soulection Radio Show #195","artwork":"/images/episodes/195.jpg","content":"Joe Kay continues the freestyle of all music. \n\n<!--more-->\nLast week's show was definitely one of my favorites to date. It's weird how things work. It's the shows that I feel most unprepared for that end up doing well... maybe it's because I just really freestyle and go off of my whole library of music rather than trying to curate a specific vibe. It was hard to top last week's show but I did my best to really take it right back to the early beat era from 2008-2012 and played some current gems as well. I hope you enjoy this. I'll be back next week with a guest maybe.\n\nBless.\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","published_at":"2014-11-29T00:00:00+00:00"}}},{"chapter":{"id":"IvrvVaky0Yw","show":{"id":"kTJOjxaMVfI","slug":"296","title":"Soulection Radio Show #296 ft. Daniel Caesar","artwork":"/images/episodes/296.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\n","published_at":"2017-02-11T00:00:00+00:00"}}},{"chapter":{"id":"y6zk-Bq1FuQ","show":{"id":"fnzkJj--oDA","slug":"315","title":"Soulection Radio Show #315","artwork":"/images/episodes/315.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\n","published_at":"2017-06-24T00:00:00+00:00"}}},{"chapter":{"id":"rBTjD90b6NE","show":{"id":"gXo3AqS_FMA","slug":"339","title":"Soulection Radio Show #339 (Live from Melbourne, Australia)","artwork":"/images/episodes/339.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\n","published_at":"2017-12-09T00:00:00+00:00"}}}],"linkedPlatforms":[{"id":45976,"platform":"soun